  "cleanText": "Solution home \n\t\tBookkeeping\n\t\tBookkeeping FAQs\n\n### How can we show CIS deducted amount while raising an Invoice?\n\n\t\t\tPrint\n\n\tModified on: Fri, 12 Nov, 2021 at  2:54 PM\n\n\t\tYou may deduct the CIS amount while creating the invoice itself by selecting \"CIS Control Account\" from the action drop down available under payment section.\n\nNavigation: Bookkeeping >> Select Client >> Sales > > Invoices >> + New Invoice\n\nonce clicking the + New invoice button\n\nEnter the information as needed.\n\nClick here to watch how to account for CIS deductions for contractors\n\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tYes\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tNo\n\nSend feedback\tSorry we couldn't be helpful. Help us improve this article with your feedback.",
